+# Radio Vault v0.28.0-alpha5 — Multipart Family Corrections
+
+Alpha5 is a focused correction release based on the complete 7,169-file alpha4 desktop truth export.
+
+## Fixed
+
+- `R&F-10-31-2002a.mp3` and `R&F-10-31-2002b.mp3` now assemble as one complete two-part recording.
+- `RaF1020-Part2-ph.mp3` no longer forms a separate recording family from parts 3–6.
+- `RaF1110-Part3-partial.mp3` no longer forms a separate recording family from parts 1, 2 and 4.
+- Context-confirmed bare-number multipart files now export their effective part numbers and totals instead of every row displaying Part 1.
+
+## Preserved safeguards
+
+V1/V2 separation, long-name/short-name lineage boundaries, leading-track protection, lone-number ambiguity, suspicious duration-family reviews, and same-date coverage audits remain in place.
+
+This release is still shadow-only and does not adopt Library Truth results into the live library.
